      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just weird though because everything looks mostly okay when the car is idling, but then as soon as i hit the gas it's like it starts acting possessed or something. it's really inconsistent. is there any reason why it would only happen under load like that? maybe something's interfering with it internally?",
